# Codeberg Pages custom-domain file (.domains)
# ---------------------------------------------
# One domain per line; the FIRST uncommented line is the canonical domain
# (others 301-redirect to it). DNS must point at Codeberg Pages:
#   www/subdomain:  CNAME spritzwine.codeberg.page.
#   apex domain:    ALIAS/ANAME to codeberg.page, or the published A/AAAA records
#
# Uncomment and edit when the domain exists — until then this file is inert:
#
# spritzwine.example.org
# www.spritzwine.example.org
